  "description": "For everything, every day\nCombining efficiently smooth riding with real-world capability and dependability, RHeO 0 takes everything we've learnt about making confidence-inspiring mountain bikes, and applies the same benefits to urban and leisure riders, too. After all, confident handling and real-world practicality are critical wherever you ride – and through whatever conditions you pedal. Whether café cruising, commuting, socialising or simply exploring the roads, lanes and bike paths less travelled, RHeO 0's enabling handling and road-smoothing ride will put you in control, everywhere.\n\nHighlights\n– Lightweight aluminum frame and fork for easy pedalling and carrying.\n– Easy to use 1x9 transmission gives you the gearing to ride everywhere easily.\n– Fast-rolling, grippy tyres and confidence-inspiring handling let you flow smoothly along even the roughest streets.\n– Reassuringly powerful and dependable all-weather hydraulic disc brakes.\n– Lightweight and easy to lift and live with.\n– Ready to take a full set of mudguards, a bike rack, kick-stand and more (RHeO 0 is compatible with our aftermarket mudguards here >).\n\nIdeal for... Riders looking for an affordable, high-quality mechanical (non-electric) bike for commuting, leisure and utility.\n\nDiscover RHeO >",
